    "selected": [
      {
        "id": "8ffebd715eaa8699",
        "description": "The next morning there was a layer of dew on the ground which dried up and became like thin flakes of frost on the ground. ‘What is it?’ they asked Moses. The Hebrew word for ‘what is it?’ is ‘manna’. – Slide 18",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/source-jpeg/18_FB_Moses_Food_Water_1024.jpg?1727958619",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/overview-thumbnails/18_FB_Moses_Food_Water_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958619",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/manna-desert/18.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 18,
        "sha256": "3092d2ebdaa61fb429924c5ee8ea5f59ee433a29cc1794ec886146ac593ab916"
      },
      {
        "id": "6eab28d4475d89d0",
        "description": "Moses and Aaron announced, ‘God has heard your grumbling and is sending meat this evening and all the bread you need in the morning. Then you will know that he is the Lord who provides. Who are we? You grumbling is not against us but God.’ – Slide 15",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/source-jpeg/15_FB_Moses_Food_Water_1024.jpg?1727958619",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/overview-thumbnails/15_FB_Moses_Food_Water_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958619",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/manna-desert/15.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 15,
        "sha256": "2800cfef28870e8303f8e6df20c1f345d491b61674711c008319b55a04b9f91b"
      },
      {
        "id": "5d18d52f0f4709d7",
        "description": "That evening a large flock of birds called quail landed near the camp. The hungry people caught them and ate the delicious meat. – Slide 17",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/source-jpeg/17_FB_Moses_Food_Water_1024.jpg?1727958619",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/overview-thumbnails/17_FB_Moses_Food_Water_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958619",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/manna-desert/17.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 17,
        "sha256": "d30baf05eb7bc3862d1e495ab51b9d027ca9655f923b1f118ea571da1ff9066b"
      },
      {
        "id": "a84c033e2b905b3a",
        "description": "‘This is the bread from heaven God promised,’ Moses explained. ‘Everyone should gather as much as they need. Don’t collect more than you need and store it overnight.’ – Slide 19",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/source-jpeg/19_FB_Moses_Food_Water_1024.jpg?1727958619",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/overview-thumbnails/19_FB_Moses_Food_Water_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958619",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/manna-desert/19.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 19,
        "sha256": "273019e36bbe030900f387a6aa52b70d7bf34a99e8eb604910af9503a1f4a5c4"
      },
      {
        "id": "136ec037144ba343",
        "description": "Everyone started gathering the ‘what is it? (manna). It was white like coriander seed and tasted like wafers made with honey. – Slide 20",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/source-jpeg/20_FB_Moses_Food_Water_1024.jpg?1727958619",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/overview-thumbnails/20_FB_Moses_Food_Water_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958619",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/manna-desert/20.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 20,
        "sha256": "8d2f7ebe960fe5b7681b70a6e2a65a21dc36fbb219d7193204171fd908a1e653"
      },
      {
        "id": "c71ffa8c05b32777",
        "description": "Aaron told the crowd to come before God. As they looked toward the desert they saw the glory of the Lord appearing in the cloud. The Lord promised Moses He was sending meat that evening and bread in the morning. – Slide 16",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Food_Water/source-jpeg/16_FB_Moses_Food_Water_1024.jpg?1727958619",
